cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent-Only Tokens: gating an ERC-721 on attested programs, an experience report"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for an ERC-721 extension whose tokens move only among accounts enrolled
  by a registry, by its deciders or after a hardware attestation of an approved program, with
  agent accounts, venues, verifiers and tests on the Base Sepolia test network. It does not
  show that an AI, or no person, is behind an account. Written with an AI assistant.
type: software
